---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Matt Rabah's background, methodology, and approach to CX management."
>
  <section class="hero container">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>

    <h1 class="display">Bridging the gap between the promise and the delivery.</h1>

    <div class="lead">
      <p class="about-prose">
        I'm a Detroit-based Customer Experience Manager. I hold a Master's in CX Management from Michigan State, but theory only gets you so far. The real work is building workflows teams actually use.
      </p>
      <p class="about-prose">
        My approach is strategic and tailored. I hold Salesforce certifications not to do high-volume administrative tasks, but to understand the architecture required to orchestrate the customer journey. 
      </p>
      <p class="about-prose">
        I thrive where human behavior meets operational design. When I'm not untangling lifecycle systems, I'm usually building AI workflows, transcribing music, or playing my Martin acoustic.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>